            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251230/extras/363d36afd91b623f7287b49cd4a07e17.poster.avif?t=1792213608\" aria-label=\"Livelock logo beside Catalyst, Hex and Vanguard in a dusty ruined city. Livelock is a co-operative top-down shooter for solo play or up to two allies, fighting mechanical enemies to break the cycle of war between machines.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251230/extras/363d36afd91b623f7287b49cd4a07e17.webm?t=1792213608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251230/extras/363d36afd91b623f7287b49cd4a07e17.mp4?t=1792213608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251230/extras/244a3fdc64e5ae49a3af2db8077b6980.avif?t=1792213608\" alt=\"Original character feature panels: Catalyst illustrates Intelligent Action, mastering weapons and enemy behaviour; Vanguard illustrates Three-Player Co-op, combining class strengths with friends; Hex illustrates Devastating Firepower, including shockwaves, combat drones and orbital lasers. The banner states that purchases include the original soundtrack.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251230/extras_big/244a3fdc64e5ae49a3af2db8077b6980.avif?t=1792213608 width=1560 height=3392 /></span>",
            "short_description": "Livelock is a co-operative top-down shooter for solo players or up to three players online. Choose Hex, Vanguard or Catalyst, unleash an arsenal of weapons and abilities, and fight through a machine-ruled world to unlock Eden and revive humanity.",
