                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Definitely a worthwhile twin-stick shooter whilst on a sale! When off, I'd say if you have friends to commit with and a liking for twin-stick shooters it could definitely be a fun little time sink.\nIt's a little short for a full campaign playthrough taking me about 5 hours solo, but it was otherwise pretty entertaining upgrading my gear and leveling up my character. Could honestly add another 10 hours to the game if you look towards playing the other two characters you have yet to play. Narratives alright, it's engaging and doesn't take you out of the story or gameplay. It's a neat little package all together, with some hoard modes and challenge trials to boot if you wanna do something beyond the campaign.",
